      "title": "Follow the tangent",
      "prose": "Take $y' = y$ with $y(0) = 1$. At $t = 0$ the slope is $y = 1$. Walk along that slope for half a year: $y(0.5) \\approx 1 + 0.5 \\times 1$. Then read the slope at the new point and walk again.",
